{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4101700/extras/eb52d34be6f70b04266573b85b5ec623.poster.avif?t=1760846352\" width=540 height=202 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4101700/extras/eb52d34be6f70b04266573b85b5ec623.webm?t=1760846352\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fully 3D sculpting</strong> in a surreal sky world! Create any shape you can imagine and sculpt your way through the gamut.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Sculpting Puzzles</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Craft sculptures</strong> to meet the increasingly strange demands of your ghostly patrons.\u00a0<strong>Match shapes, maintain symmetry, get the right silhouette, and add a pinch of chaos</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4101700/extras/3af04e53328a889c83a7415b0997c672.poster.avif?t=1760846352\" width=1080 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4101700/extras/3af04e53328a889c83a7415b0997c672.webm?t=1760846352\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4101700/extras/3af04e53328a889c83a7415b0997c672.mp4?t=1760846352\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build-your-own Platforms</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Four worlds of <strong>precision sculpture-platforming</strong> levels, each with unique mechanics. <strong>Build bridges, carve stairs, navigate moving sculptures, choose the right locations to plant sculptures</strong>, and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4101700/extras/721411606cb4ae87c4c38712bdb6e423.poster.avif?t=1760846352\" width=1080 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4101700/extras/721411606cb4ae87c4c38712bdb6e423.webm?t=1760846352\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4101700/extras/721411606cb4ae87c4c38712bdb6e423.mp4?t=1760846352\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Create Your Way</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unlock new tools and studios</strong>\u00a0as you play. In free sculpt, the sky is the limit (because you're stuck in the clouds).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4101700/extras/6ce93bae064ba08a9ff8a35f770e52c7.poster.avif?t=1760846352\" width=1080 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4101700/extras/6ce93bae064ba08a9ff8a35f770e52c7.webm?t=1760846352\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4101700/extras/6ce93bae064ba08a9ff8a35f770e52c7.mp4?t=1760846352\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Did you choose to come to the clouds? Can you find your way home?\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4101700/extras/8b07e3e5b7c0c539767a32575e5288d1.poster.avif